7. Pin Cheatsheet for ESP32 
UART0: GPIO1 (TX), GPIO3 (RX) — extra UARTs available
I2C (default): SDA = GPIO21, SCL = GPIO22
SPI (default): MOSI = 23, MISO = 19, SCK = 18, CS = 5

